# .gitignore : what this repo does NOT commit.
#
# Tracked on purpose: source, configs, docs, notebooks, trained checkpoints/,
# the gold label set, and a curated reports/ record. Market data is never
# committed (Alpaca terms): rebuild it with the data pipeline. Everything
# regenerable-and-heavy or purely runtime is ignored.

# --- Market data and local notes ---
data/processed/
.nb/
CLAUDE.md

# --- Python ---
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
.pytest_cache/
.venv/
venv/
*.egg-info/
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# --- Secrets / environment ---
.env
.env.local

# --- OS cruft ---
.DS_Store

# --- Logs (runtime only; scripts recreate logs/{training,paper,fleet}/) ---
logs/
*.log

# --- Raw market data (regenerable from Alpaca; ~188M of 1-min bars) ---
# The processed model inputs in data/processed/ ARE tracked (frozen, ~38M) so
# results reproduce without API keys or a re-download. The raw bars are not.
data/raw/*
!data/raw/.gitkeep

# --- Ephemeral model outputs ---
data/processed/test_predictions*.npz

# --- reports/ : runtime output, ignored except a curated summaries-only record ---
# Allowlist the canonical dirs below; bloat (html/npz/parquet/plots) is never
# tracked. Add a new canonical dir with one `!` line.
# See docs/development.md and tests/rigor/test_reports_layout.py.
reports/*
!reports/rigor/
!reports/inspect/
!reports/notebook_figures/
reports/rigor/*
reports/inspect/*

# milestones
!reports/rigor/07-Jun-26/
!reports/rigor/09-Jun-26/
!reports/rigor/2026-05-13/
!reports/rigor/transformer_fairshot_2026-06-07_183725/
# baselines + tuned carrier runs ({kind}_{arch}_{tf})
!reports/rigor/baselines/
!reports/rigor/tune_cnn_lstm_5m/
!reports/rigor/tune_cnn_lstm_15m/
!reports/rigor/bootstrap_cnn_lstm_5m/
!reports/rigor/bootstrap_cnn_lstm_15m/
# named sweeps
!reports/inspect/tradesim_2026-06-15/

# bloat never tracked, even inside an allowlisted dir
reports/**/*.html
reports/**/*.npz
reports/**/*.parquet
reports/**/plots/

# --- Demo animator (vendored JS, fetched at build time, not committed) ---
src/demo/vendor/
